          <div class="about-copy">
            <p class="hello">Hello.</p>
            <p>
              I am an Sc.M. student in Biostatistics at Brown University. My work combines statistical methodology and reproducible computing for
              biomedical research, with current projects in statistical genomics and longitudinal mental-health studies.
            </p>
            <p>
              I am interested in how structured information can improve learning from complex, high-dimensional data, and in making the resulting
              analyses transparent to scientific collaborators.
            </p>
            <div class="inline-links" aria-label="Featured links">
